{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve the history snapshot that passed polling. `context.execution_history` comes from a separate history request after `PollingValidator.validate()` succeeds; that refetch may return `None` while the core still returns a passing result with `{}`. Both case-11 suites then fail here claiming no unique `ChainedInvokeStarted`, although polling already matched it. Carry the last successful polling history into `DescriptionResult` (or retry/fail the final refetch) and add a successful-poll/failing-refetch regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx87_CItO","finding_digest":"3f2a1857df0d06b352898085867c724110f647f74574a2cba2813b52655f9c96","finding_id":"arf_v1_h4vbqv67budlguujqccym7dsie","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py::otelextension.validate_telemetry::successful-history-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py::otelextension.validate_telemetry::successful-history-preservation","line":236,"observation_digest":"06167ddad9c882570dde2a44e8996ddd208de3dec5d144b584de01c58152bec6","observation_id":"aro_v1_aylh3wwzzcbfodo6fjcorgln3u","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-15T03:37:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rs5dkaud3vka32vl52yc3gh4b3","reviewed_base_sha":"e48ac54502d3c14e2e3fa216c5e200dbb4c14ac2","reviewed_head_sha":"b7206e0714aaecf3ca1f178b9feeccdd940deda5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":236,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_nqe3yxrrbho5p2k4mzxedhc36q","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-15T03:37:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
